Increases your Accuracy by [2, 6, 12, 18, 25 (STR 10-100; DEX 10-100)], the damage multiplier of your striking talents (Pugilism and Finishing Moves) by [25%, 34%, 45%, 53%, 60% (STR 10-100; DEX 10-100)], and reduces all damage taken by [1, 7, 15, 23, 30 (STR 10-100; DEX 10-100)].

The offensive bonuses scale with your Dexterity and the damage reduction with your Strength.
